	(text "RAIL        V     LOADS                                 I TYP    I MAX     LDO        BUCK  LDO VIN  PDN\n----------  ----  ------------------------------------  -------  --------  ---------  ----  -------  -----\nPLL1        +3.3  ADF4351 #1 (125 MHz clock)            165 mA   195 mA    LDO2-A     A     4.3 V    D4\nPLL2        +3.3  ADF4351 #2 (cal / vernier)            150 mA   170 mA    LDO2-B     A     4.3 V    D4\nDELAY       +3.3  MC100EP195 + strobe FF (EP52)         230 mA   275 mA    LDO3-A     B     4.3 V    D4\nCLK         +3.3  LMK00304 + fire FF (EP52)             215 mA   300 mA    LDO3-B     B     4.3 V    D4\nVCCO_SMP    +3.3  ADCMP582 #1 sampler VCCO              44 mA    55 mA     LDO5-A     H     4.3 V    C\nVCCO_STEP   +3.3  ADCMP582 #2 step driver VCCO          44 mA    55 mA     LDO5-B     H     4.3 V    C\nVCCO_TRIG   +3.3  ADCMP582 #3 trigger VCCO              44 mA    55 mA     LDO4-A     C     4.3 V    C\nREF         +3.3  Si53360, REF IN/OUT buffers, TCXO     80 mA*   120 mA*   LDO4-B     C     4.3 V    C\n+5V_CMP     +5.0  ADCMP582 x3 VCCI, LT1678 V+           23 mA    32 mA     LDO1-A     D     6.0 V    RC x4\n+5V_DAC     +5.0  LTC2642 VDD, REF5030 VIN              3 mA*    5 mA*     LDO1-B     D     6.0 V    RC x2\n-5V_SMP     -5.0  ADCMP582 #1 VEE, LT1678 V-            30 mA*   43 mA*    LDO6       E     -6.0 V   C\n-5V_ST      -5.0  ADCMP582 #2 + #3 VEE                  50 mA    70 mA     LDO7       E     -6.0 V   RC x2\n+5V_OCXO    +5.0  OCXO                                  170 mA*  600 mA*   none (LC)  F     5.0 V    -\n+3V3_LOGIC  +3.3  LVC glue, TLV3601 x3, TMP117, EEPROM  60 mA*   100 mA*   NCP59749   G     5.0 V    plain\n+5V_DIG     +5.0  Cyclone IV board + Nucleo             600 mA*  1000 mA*  none       G     5.0 V    -"
